---
title: First run · one step (repeated per check)
---
flowchart TD
  S([Step card]) --> C{"Observe<br/>(read-only)"}
  C -->|ok| Next([Next step])
  C -->|unknown| U["Unknown: show why,<br/>Check again"]
  C -->|needs action| A{"Admin rights?"}
  A -->|no| R["Run (app runs hack)"]
  A -->|yes| T["Copy command /<br/>Open Terminal"]
  R --> C
  T -->|Check again| C
  U -->|Check again| C
  C -. Skip .-> Next
  classDef wait stroke-dasharray:2 2
  classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
  class T wait
  class Next ok
